{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724260/extras/about_header_title.gif?t=1748617059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose between four playable heroes and upgrade up to 2 skill trees.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can freely explore one area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 3 bosses for you to hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play online co-op or invade(pvp) other players during a hunt. Up to 1 cooperator and 1 invader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only English language is supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**Note: This game is a free demo. The dev team needs support and feedback to continue development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the discussion in Community Hub to report bugs and leave feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724260?t=1748617059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724260/65a9a77be0eada1ca9ffb32229d891f7e67535ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748617059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724260/14655f0ef53849b04399c9d29a71aa7cde130955/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748617059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724260/14655f0ef53849b04399c9d29a71aa7cde130955/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748617059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_d